            <p>If you choose a Piedmont train, the journey feels short and efficient with modern amenities. The Carolinian offers a slightly longer but well-connected travel experience with the ability to continue north. The time difference between train types is minimal, so choosing the right option depends more on schedule and onward travel needs. This route is ideal for same-day travel due to its short duration.</p>
