            <p>Most trains from Charlotte to Raleigh depart from Charlotte Amtrak Station (1914 N Tryon Street), located northeast of Uptown Charlotte.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>It's recommended to arrive 20-30 minutes before departure</li>
                <li>The station offers a waiting area, restrooms, and vending machines</li>
                <li>Free parking is available adjacent to the station</li>
                <li>You'll find taxi and rideshare pickup areas nearby</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Boarding Process</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Platforms are usually announced 15-20 minutes before departure</li>
                <li>Boarding is generally quick and straightforward</li>
                <li>Seats are not assigned on Piedmont trains - choose any available seat</li>
                <li>There are no airport-style security checks, which saves time</li>
                <li>Conductors check tickets onboard after departure</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Onboard Experience</h3>
            <p>The train from Charlotte to Raleigh offers a comfortable and efficient travel experience.</p>
            <ul>
